{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-psychology","title":"认知心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.36,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"认知心理学-简介\">认知心理学 简介</h1><p>认知心理学是研究人类心智运作方式的核心学科。它探讨我们如何感知外部世界、如何选择和分配注意力、如何编码与提取记忆、如何理解和产生语言，以及如何进行推理与决策。认知心理学不仅是心理学的重要分支，更为人工智能、人机交互、教育设计和临床诊断等领域提供了深厚的理论基础。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对人类认知过程感兴趣的技术人员和心理学爱好者。无论你是希望将认知科学应用于产品设计的前端工程师、正在探索类脑计算的AI研究者，还是对学习效率提升有需求的终身学习者，这里都将帮助你建立对人类认知系统的系统性理解。</p>\n<p>全书共分五个章节，涵盖认知心理学的核心主题：</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>感觉与知觉</strong>从视觉感知、听觉感知、多感觉整合到知觉恒常性，带你理解大脑如何将外部物理刺激转化为有意义的心理体验，揭示感知背后的神经计算机制。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>注意力</strong>系统讲解选择性注意、分配性注意、持续性注意和注意障碍，帮助你理解注意力作为认知资源门控系统的运作原理和失调表现。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>记忆系统</strong>深入工作记忆、长期记忆、遗忘与记忆错误以及记忆提升策略，从多存储模型到建构性记忆的前沿研究，全面呈现记忆的编码、存储与提取机制。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>语言与认知</strong>涵盖语言习得、语言理解、双语认知和语言与思维的关系，探讨人类独有的语言能力如何塑造认知过程和思维方式。</p>\n<p>第5章<strong>思维与决策</strong>围绕问题解决、创造性思维、判断启发式和决策模型展开，揭示人类在推理与选择过程中的认知策略与系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序学习，因为感知是认知的入口，注意力是认知的过滤器，记忆是认知的存储系统，语言是认知的表达工具，思维与决策则是认知的最高形式。如果你有特定兴趣，也可以直接进入对应章节——每章都具有相对独立的知识结构。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"perception-sensation","title":"感觉与知觉","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/perception-sensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visual-perception","title":"视觉感知与错觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/perception-sensation/visual-perception"},{"seq":2,"slug":"auditory-perception","title":"听觉感知与语音加工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/perception-sensation/auditory-perception"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multisensory-integration","title":"多感觉整合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/perception-sensation/multisensory-integration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"perceptual-constancy","title":"知觉恒常性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/perception-sensation/perceptual-constancy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"attention","title":"注意力","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/attention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"selective-attention","title":"选择性注意","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/attention/selective-attention"},{"seq":2,"slug":"divided-attention","title":"分配性注意","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/attention/divided-attention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustained-attention","title":"持续性注意","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/attention/sustained-attention"},{"seq":4,"slug":"attention-disorders","title":"注意障碍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/attention/attention-disorders"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-systems","title":"记忆系统","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/memory-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"working-memory","title":"工作记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/memory-systems/working-memory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"long-term-memory","title":"长期记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/memory-systems/long-term-memory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"forgetting-memory-errors","title":"遗忘与记忆错误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/memory-systems/forgetting-memory-errors"},{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-improvement","title":"记忆提升策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/memory-systems/memory-improvement"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"language-cognition","title":"语言与认知","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/language-cognition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-acquisition","title":"语言习得","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/language-cognition/language-acquisition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-comprehension","title":"语言理解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/language-cognition/language-comprehension"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bilingualism-cognition","title":"双语认知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/language-cognition/bilingualism-cognition"},{"seq":4,"slug":"language-thought-relationship","title":"语言与思维的关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/language-cognition/language-thought-relationship"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"thinking-decision","title":"思维与决策","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/thinking-decision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-solving","title":"问题解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/thinking-decision/problem-solving"},{"seq":2,"slug":"creative-thinking","title":"创造性思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/thinking-decision/creative-thinking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"judgment-heuristics","title":"判断启发式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/thinking-decision/judgment-heuristics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"decision-making-models","title":"决策模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/cognitive-psychology/thinking-decision/decision-making-models"}]}]}